@stockUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orderUrl = http://localhost:8082
@accountUrl = http://localhost:8083

### 查询库存：全新环境商品 1、2 各有 100 库存
GET {{stockUrl}}/stocks/1

### 查询账户：用户 1 初始余额 10000 元，用户 2 初始余额 1 元
GET {{accountUrl}}/accounts/1

### 正常下单：201 / SUCCESS；重复发送同一 requestId 不重复扣减
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"demo-success-1","userId":1,"productId":1,"quantity":1}

### 查询订单：替换为下单响应中的 id
GET {{orderUrl}}/orders/1

### 余额不足：409 / CLOSED，已扣库存通过补偿归还
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"demo-balance-failure-1","userId":2,"productId":1,"quantity":1}

### 两次扣减后模拟异常：409 / CLOSED，账户退款并归还库存
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"demo-compensation-1","userId":1,"productId":1,"quantity":1,"exception":true}

### 库存不足：409 / CLOSED，账户不扣款
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"demo-stock-failure-1","userId":1,"productId":1,"quantity":1000}
